sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Client
    participant G as Gateway
    participant R as Redis
    participant S as Service
    participant F as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant C as Controller
    participant SV as Service logic

    B->>G: request with Authorization: Bearer JWT
    G->>G: strip any X-User-* headers the client sent
    alt path under /internal/**
        G-->>B: 404 (before authentication)
    else path on the public allow-list
        G->>R: rate limit by client address
        G->>S: forward without a token check
    else protected path
        G->>G: verify signature, issuer, expiry (30 s skew), typ = ACCESS
        alt token missing, expired or a refresh token
            G-->>B: 401 AUTHENTICATION_REQUIRED
        else valid
            G->>R: rate limit (session calls have their own larger budget)
            G->>G: add X-User-Id, Role, Email, Profile-Id (logs only)
            G->>S: forward (circuit breaker + bulkhead)
        end
    end

    S->>F: filter chain
    F->>F: verify the JWT again with the shared secret
    F->>F: build AppPrincipal(userId, email, name, role, profileId)
    S->>C: handler
    C->>C: @PreAuthorize with Roles constant
    alt role not allowed
        C-->>B: 403
    else allowed
        C->>SV: call with the principal
        SV->>SV: ownership check: student reads own records, trainer only own batches
        alt not the owner
            SV-->>B: 403 ACCESS_DENIED
        else owner or staff
            SV-->>B: 200 with data
        end
    end
